\label{newprop2}
With the notation of Lemma \ref{newprop1},
given a nonnegative function $\phi \in C^\infty(M)$,
suppose that $f \in C^\infty(M)$ satisfies
\begin{equation}
4 |\nabla f|^2 \: \le \: R \: - \: \lambda_M \: - \: c
\end{equation}
on $\supp(\phi)$, for some $c > 0$. Then

